  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\quad$ Mode $=3$ Median -2 Mean\r\n\r\n$\\therefore \\quad$ Median $=\\frac{1}{3}($ mode +2 mean $)=\\frac{1}{3}(60+2 \\times 66)=64$"
  }
